/Title (A\040Systematic\040Method\040of\040Optimization\040of\040Machining\040Parameters\040Considering\040Energy\040Consumption\054\040Machining\040time\040and\040Surface\040Roughness\040with\040Experimental\040Analysis)
/Author (Chunhua\040Feng\054\040Haohao\040Guo\054\040Jingyang\040Zhang\054\040Yugui\040Huang\054\040Shi\040Huang)
/Subject (\012\040For\040improving\040energy\040efficiency\040of\040machining\040process\054\040extensive\040studies\040have\040focused\040on\040how\040to\040establish\040energy\040consumption\040model\040and\040optimize\040cutting\040parameters\056\040However\054\040the\040existing\040methods\040lack\040a\040systematic\040method\040to\040promote\040the\040widespread\040use\040of\040energy\040efficiency\040methods\040in\040the\040industry\056\040This\040paper\040proposes\040a\040systematic\040method\040integrating\040energy\040model\054\040experiment\040design\054\040and\040multi\055objective\040optimization\040model\056\040Firstly\054\040the\040energy\040model\040is\040established\040considering\040cutting\040energy\040and\040non\055cutting\040energy\056\040Then\054\040the\040orthogonal\040experiment\040is\040designed\040with\040the\040three\040levels\040of\040four\040factors\040of\040spindle\040speed\054\040feed\040speed\054\040cutting\040depth\054\040and\040cutting\040width\040in\040the\040X\040and\040Y\040cutting\040directions\056\040The\040data\040of\040energy\040consumption\054\040surface\040quality\040and\040machining\040time\040are\040obtained\040to\040study\040the\040effects\040of\040different\040cutting\040elements\040and\040cutting\040directions\056\040Meanwhile\054\040the\040standby\054\040spindle\040idling\054\040feed\054\040SEC\054\040material\040cutting\040and\040idling\040feed\040models\040of\040the\040CNC\040machine\040tools\040are\040established\040based\040on\040the\040experimental\040data\056\040In\040addition\054\040for\040verifying\040the\040accuracy\040of\040the\040established\040energy\040consumption\040model\054\040five\040sets\040of\040experimental\040data\040are\040tested\040that\040show\040the\040prediction\040accuracy\040can\040reach\04099\0564\045\056\040Finally\054\040a\040multi\055objective\040optimization\040model\040for\040high\040efficiency\040and\040energy\040saving\040of\040processing\040process\040is\040establishes\040to\040optimize\040the\040cutting\040parameters\040from\040the\040three\040perspectives\040of\040energy\040consumption\054\040processing\040time\040and\040surface\040quality\056\040Combining\040the\040case\040of\040milling\040with\040constraints\040including\040machine\040tool\040performance\054\040tool\040life\054\040processing\040procedures\054\040and\040processing\040requirements\054\040the\040Pareto\040solution\040set\040is\040used\040to\040solve\040the\040Pareto\040of\040the\040target\040model\056\040Through\040drawing\040a\040three\055dimensional\040needle\040graph\040and\040two\055dimensional\040histogram\054\040the\040optimal\040cutting\040parameter\040combination\040for\040rough\040machining\040and\040semi\055finish\040machining\040are\040provided\054\040assisting\040in\040promoting\040the\040application\040of\040the\040sustainable\040techniques\040in\040the\040industry\056)
